      ],
      "notes": "Route number is the order in the 20 Oct 2011 Secretary Transport notification as reported on the KP govt portal (1st..4th route); stop order is as listed after 'via'. Original URL http://www.khyberpakhtunkhwa.gov.pk/GoServices/NewsDetails.php?NewsId=2346 (dead; Wayback copy used). Geo/APP 23 Oct 2011 gives a shorter via-list for the same 4 routes and says a 10-year plan would divide Peshawar into 88 routes. No evidence found that CNG vans actually ran on these routes; any such service was superseded by the 2019-20 BRT bus-industry restructuring, hence status historical. 'General Bus Stand Kohat Road' is the Peshawar GBS on Kohat Road (Geo misprints it as 'General Bus Stand Kohat')."
